        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/azqa/{size}/2015_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-23T21:16:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Before they added that to the FAQ, I'd sent in a question about the possibility of stretch goals or future expansions possibly allowing for more than 4 players. &nbsp;This was the response:</p><blockquote><p>Currently, there are no plans to introduce that for this Kickstarter, as increasing this game beyond four involves a lot more than just a few rules changes. If we way overfund, there exists a small chance that a 5-6 player expansion may make it in, but that is definitely just a chance.</p></blockquote><p><span>Based on the responses I think a future expansion in a separate Kickstarter is probably more likely to happen than something in this one, but we'll see :)</span></p>",
